# Development: leave VITE_API_URL unset so the browser uses relative `/api/...` and Vite proxies to the Nest server.
#
# If the proxy fails with ECONNREFUSED, Nest is not running on the proxy target — start `npm run start:dev`
# from the repo root, or point this at your API (no trailing slash):
# API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:3000
#
# Only set VITE_API_URL when the SPA must call the API on another origin (bypasses Vite proxy in dev):
# Must be the API **origin** only — do not append `/api` (paths already include `/api/...`):
# VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000
#
# Production (Safari Omni): set at **build time** on Render (Static Site) or in CI.
# Same origin (SPA + API on https://safariomni.com): leave VITE_API_URL unset — requests use relative /api.
# Split origin (API on another hostname): set the API base, no trailing slash:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.safariomni.com
